Third-party assets
------------------

Fabri Studio's Settings surface renders the Slack, GitHub, and Linear brand
marks (examples/studio/src/components/BrandMark.tsx). The path data comes from
Simple Icons (https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons), released under
CC0-1.0. The marks themselves remain trademarks of their respective owners and
are used solely to identify the service each integration connects to, rendered
monochrome and unmodified per those owners' brand guidelines.
